<title>USA: Corning acquires Optical Corp of America.</title>
<headline>Corning acquires Optical Corp of America.</headline>
<dateline>CORNING, N.Y. 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corning Inc will acquire  Optical Corp of America, a supplier of opto-electronic components and systems for communications, medical, and other applications, Corning said Wednesday.</p>
<p>The terms of the agreement were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Optical had sales of approximately $30 million in 1996.</p>
<p>Upon completion of the transaction, Corning, will integrate Optical Corp of America with its Photonic Technologies Division.</p>
